<section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-14"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Services Snapshot</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Our Core <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Comprehensive certification, audit, and inspection services trusted by businesses worldwide</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 overflow- flex flex-col transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-euro-300 group"><div class="relative h-44 overflow-hidden"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581091226825-a6a2a5aee158?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85" alt="Engineer examining industrial equipment" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute top-4 left-4 w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600/10 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-euro-600 text-sm"></i></div></div><div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-1"><h3 class="heading-font text-base font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">ISO Certifications</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-[13px] leading-relaxed mb-5 flex-1">Internationally recognised management system certifications including ISO 9001, ISO 14001, ISO 45001, ISO 27001, ISO 50001 and more.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 self-start heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-[0_10px_20px_rgba(212,168,6